    "body": "I have updated the `update_smileys.py` script so that we can block and unblock smiley without loosing information. I have used the script for removing 祝 and 秘. See https://github.com/TokTok/qTox/issues/613.\n\n<!-- Reviewable:start -->\n- - -\nThis change is [<img src=\"https://reviewable.io/review_button.svg\" height=\"34\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"Reviewable\"/>](https://reviewable.io/reviews/TokTok/qTox/699)\n<!-- Reviewable:end -->\n",
